
Remove a fallthrough annotation that falls through to nothing.

The last case of string_hash's switch ends with Z3_fallthrough; but there is no
case label after it, only the closing brace.  clang rejects that outright
("fallthrough annotation does not directly precede switch label"), so Z3 4.5.0
does not build on a current toolchain.  It is the only such spot in the tree.

--- a/src/util/hash.cpp	2026-09-09 11:51:50.302684073 +0400
+++ b/src/util/hash.cpp	2026-09-09 11:51:50.314038888 +0400
@@ -83,7 +83,6 @@
         Z3_fallthrough;
     case 1 : 
         a+=str[0];
-        Z3_fallthrough;
         /* case 0: nothing left to add */
     }
     mix(a,b,c);
